    <item>
      <title>Primele ninsori au căzut pe Transfăgărășan, unde drumarii intervin cu utilaje</title>
      <link>https://izz.ro/judetean/ninge-pe-transfagarasan-iar-drumarii-intervin-cu-utilaje-de-deszapezire/</link>
      <guid>https://izz.ro/judetean/ninge-pe-transfagarasan-iar-drumarii-intervin-cu-utilaje-de-deszapezire/</guid>
